{
"recipe_id":"1 Carmel Brasied Pork",
"source_text":"Red brasied pork - Recipe 2\n\n用料\n五花肉 800克\n鸡蛋 5个\n八角 1个\n葱 1根\n桂皮 1块\n香叶 2片\n冰糖 1把\n料酒 半勺\n盐 适量\n老抽 2勺\n生抽 2勺\n耗油 半勺\n鸡精 适量\n十三香 适量 \n\n做法\n把肉都切方块，大小均匀。\n冷水下锅，撇去浮沫，然后不用煮很长时间，开了3分钟就可以。\n准备炒肉的香料。\n油锅下冰糖，我抓了一把，大家可以看准备的肉多少来订冰糖的量，出来小泡沫就可以下肉。\n看看，冰糖上的颜色特别棒，然后下香料，不用炒很长时间，时间长了肉就硬，老了，出来香味就开水，是开水。\n热水一次性加足，不然最后味道都淡了，我换的砂锅，开始炖，砂锅散热慢，每次都是用砂锅。\n这三样是我做红烧肉必须准备的，红豆腐乳可以上色，一块就可以，然后倒点豆腐乳的红汁，蜂蜜是肉出锅前淋的，使红烧肉色泽亮红，微甜，味道特别好，冰糖是上色用的。\n调味：生抽是2，老抽2勺，耗油半勺，冰糖5颗，鸡精和十三香都是适量，大家可以按照肉量来捏准量，盐适量，好多人都是把盐放在最后放，我都是提前放，感觉都入味才好吃，盐别放多了，因为酱油里面都是有盐，而且红烧肉不只是咸，是微微甜的。\n这是炖了一会的图片，，然后把火调小点，不是最小，比最小大一点。\n这是炖了1个多点了，，快出锅了，准备大火收汁，一定别离开，别离开，别离开，收汁过程颜色会加深，然后淋点蜂蜜，调好，装盘。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "把肉都切方块，大小均匀。", "text_en": "Cut all the pork into evenly sized cubes.", "start_char": 123, "end_char": 135, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "冷水下锅", "text_en": "Put cold water into the pot.", "start_char": 136, "end_char": 140, "node_indices": [3, 4], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 2, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "冷水下锅", "text_en": "Put the pork into the pot of cold water.", "start_char": 136, "end_char": 140, "node_indices": [2, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 3, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "撇去浮沫", "text_en": "Skim off the foam.", "start_char": 141, "end_char": 145, "node_indices": [4, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "开了3分钟就可以。", "text_en": "Once boiling, cook for 3 minutes; that is enough.", "start_char": 156, "end_char": 165, "node_indices": [5, 6], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 5, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "准备炒肉的香料。", "text_en": "Prepare the spices for frying the pork.", "start_char": 166, "end_char": 174, "node_indices": [7, 8, 9, 10, 11], "edge_indices": [6, 7, 8, 9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 7, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 9, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 9, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "油锅", "text_en": "Use an oiled wok.", "start_char": 175, "end_char": 177, "node_indices": [13, 14], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 10, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 10, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "下冰糖，我抓了一把", "text_en": "Add rock sugar to the wok; I used a handful.", "start_char": 177, "end_char": 186, "node_indices": [12, 14], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 11, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "出来小泡沫", "text_en": "Heat the sugar until small bubbles appear.", "start_char": 205, "end_char": 210, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 12, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 12, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "就可以下肉。", "text_en": "Then add the pork.", "start_char": 210, "end_char": 216, "node_indices": [6, 15], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "然后下香料", "text_en": "Then add the prepared spices.", "start_char": 230, "end_char": 235, "node_indices": [11, 15], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 14, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "不用炒很长时间，", "text_en": "Do not fry the pork for very long.", "start_char": 236, "end_char": 244, "node_indices": [15, 16], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 15, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "出来香味就开水，是开水。\n热水一次性加足，", "text_en": "Once fragrant, add boiling water—make sure it is hot water—and add enough all at once.", "start_char": 255, "end_char": 276, "node_indices": [16, 17], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 16, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "我换的砂锅，开始炖，", "text_en": "Switch to a clay pot and begin simmering.", "start_char": 286, "end_char": 296, "node_indices": [16, 18, 19], "edge_indices": [17, 18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 17, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "红豆腐乳可以上色，一块就可以，", "text_en": "Add one piece of red fermented tofu to color the pork.", "start_char": 326, "end_char": 341, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 19, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 19, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "然后倒点豆腐乳的红汁，", "text_en": "Then pour in a little of the fermented tofu's red liquid.", "start_char": 341, "end_char": 352, "node_indices": [19, 21], "edge_indices": [20], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 20, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 20, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "生抽是2，", "text_en": "Season with 2 spoonfuls of light soy sauce.", "start_char": 392, "end_char": 397, "node_indices": [19, 22], "edge_indices": [21], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 21, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 21, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "老抽2勺，", "text_en": "Add 2 spoonfuls of dark soy sauce.", "start_char": 397, "end_char": 402, "node_indices": [19, 23], "edge_indices": [22], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 22, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 22, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "耗油半勺，", "text_en": "Add half a spoonful of oyster sauce.", "start_char": 402, "end_char": 407, "node_indices": [19, 24], "edge_indices": [23], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 23, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 23, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S020", "text": "冰糖5颗，", "text_en": "Add 5 pieces of rock sugar.", "start_char": 407, "end_char": 412, "node_indices": [19, 25], "edge_indices": [24], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 24, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 24, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S021", "text": "鸡精和十三香都是适量，", "text_en": "Add an appropriate amount of chicken seasoning.", "start_char": 412, "end_char": 423, "node_indices": [19, 26], "edge_indices": [25], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 26, "edge_index": 25, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 25, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S022", "text": "鸡精和十三香都是适量，", "text_en": "Add an appropriate amount of thirteen-spice powder.", "start_char": 412, "end_char": 423, "node_indices": [19, 27], "edge_indices": [26], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 27, "edge_index": 26, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 26, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S023", "text": "盐适量，", "text_en": "Add salt to taste.", "start_char": 436, "end_char": 440, "node_indices": [19, 28], "edge_indices": [27], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 27, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 27, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S024", "text": "然后把火调小点，不是最小，比最小大一点。", "text_en": "Then lower the heat a little, keeping it slightly above the lowest setting.", "start_char": 514, "end_char": 534, "node_indices": [19, 29], "edge_indices": [28], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 28, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 29, "edge_index": 28, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S025", "text": "这是炖了1个多点了，", "text_en": "The pork has now simmered for a little over 1 hour.", "start_char": 535, "end_char": 545, "node_indices": [29, 30], "edge_indices": [29], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 29, "edge_index": 29, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 29, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S026", "text": "准备大火收汁，", "text_en": "Turn up the heat to reduce the sauce.", "start_char": 551, "end_char": 558, "node_indices": [30, 31], "edge_indices": [30], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 30, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 30, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S027", "text": "然后淋点蜂蜜，", "text_en": "Then drizzle on a little honey.", "start_char": 582, "end_char": 589, "node_indices": [31, 32, 33], "edge_indices": [31, 32], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 32, "edge_index": 31, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 31, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 32, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 33, "edge_index": 32, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S028", "text": "调好，", "text_en": "Finish adjusting the seasoning.", "start_char": 589, "end_char": 592, "node_indices": [33, 34], "edge_indices": [33], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 33, "edge_index": 33, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 34, "edge_index": 33, "role": "output"}]}],
